## Conclusion

This project provided practical experience in Linux security hardening and monitoring. SSH, UFW Firewall, Fail2Ban, authentication logs, system updates, listening ports, and related processes were checked.

No suspicious activity was identified during the performed checks. The system had 205 available package updates, showing the importance of regularly applying security updates.


